  description: " (\u706D\u4E16\u96F7) Ng\u01B0ng t\u1EE5 Nguy\xEAn Anh chi l\u1EF1c
    n\u01A1i ch\u01B0\u1EDFng t\xE2m, d\u1EABn \u0111\u1ED9ng thi\xEAn l\xF4i gi\xE1ng
    th\u1EBF. Khi xu\u1EA5t th\u1EE7, l\xF4i quang kh\xF4ng c\xF2n l\xE0 tia \u0111i\u1EC7n
    \u0111\u01A1n l\u1EBB m\xE0 h\xF3a th\xE0nh l\xF4i tr\u1EE5 cu\u1ED3ng b\u1EA1o,
